OL,3,GNEWSAPostcard finally arrives 37 years
OL,4,Aafter being sent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA postcard sent during a holiday in
OL,7,FFrance in 1989, has finally arrived at
OL,8,Fits destination in Cornwall after 37
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FAlison Reed-Richards sent the postcard
OL,12,Ffrom Bauge-en-Anjou on 6 September
OL,13,F1989, but it did not reach her former
OL,14,Ffamily home in Breage near Helston
OL,15,Funtil 4 November 2026.
OL,17,FHer brother, Danny Reed, said it was
OL,18,F"miraculous that it's got to us now",
OL,19,Fand wants to know where it has been for
OL,20,Fthe last three and a half decades.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
