OL,3,GNEWSAPostcard finally arrives 37 years
OL,4,Aafter being sent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe postcard, which has a picture of
OL,7,FChateau de Bauge castle in the Loire
OL,8,FValley on the front, arrived with a
OL,9,FFrench 200 Franc stamp, dated 1989, as
OL,10,Fwell as a modern day second class King
OL,11,FCharles III stamp.
